"New Sybaris is F City's casino and nightlife district, near the coast."
"Its casinos have flashing lights and Argold slot machines, and music thumps in its streets."
"An arched screen roof over its crowded main street shows images like flying macaws."
"Performers work above the crowds, such as a silver-winged woman six meters up."
"Friendly chefs there hand out kitchen scraps from five different planets."
"Adults check the ages of kids in New Sybaris, and Chainers are banned from its casinos."
